  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: N/A</em></p>\n<p>As a bonus action while touching a weapon, you can spend cursed energy up to half your proficiency bonus (rounded down) to enhance that weapon. The weapon gains a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls for every cursed energy spent (to a maximum of +3) for 1 hour. This does not stack with a weapon’s bonus if it already has a bonus to attack and damage rolls.</p>",
